# CatDex — Navigation

## Router

- File-based routes under `app/` (expo-router)
- Root stack: `(auth)`, `(tabs)`, modals (`scanner`, `discovery`, `reward`), `cat/[id]`, `settings/*`, `auth/callback`

## Auth gates

- `app/index.tsx`: no user → `/(auth)/welcome`; else `getPostAuthHref(onboardingCompleted)`
- Incomplete onboarding → `/(auth)/intro` (then photo → permissions → onboarding-reward)
- Completed → `/(tabs)/map`

## Tabs

- `app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx` uses **custom chrome** (`tabBar={() => null}`)
- Tab screens: `map`, `catdex`, `missions`, `profile`
- Map HUD owns Capture / Missions / CatDex entry points (`MapExplorerHud`)

## Capture entry

- Prefer `useCaptureGate` for camera permission before `/scanner`
- Pass `worldId` when capturing a map spawn/mystery pin

## Rules

- Use `router.push` / `replace` / `Redirect` — don’t nest NavigationContainers
- Legacy permission routes redirect; don’t rebuild full-screen permission tutorials
- Deep links: scheme `catdex`; OAuth returns via `app/auth/callback`
